WEBVTT

17:33.704 --> 17:35.331
What are you telling him now?

17:35.456 --> 17:37.791
Only what the little lord wants to hear.

17:37.916 --> 17:40.461
Get your supper. I want some time with him.

17:51.180 --> 17:53.390
- (DOOR CLOSES)
- One time she told me

17:53.515 --> 17:55.726
the sky is blue
because we live inside the eye

17:55.851 --> 17:58.604
of a blue-eyed giant named Macomber.

17:58.729 --> 18:00.814
Maybe we do.
